      ],
      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "This Continuous Trap negates the effects of all other Trap Cards on the field while its own continuous effect applies. It does not prevent a Trap Card or Trap effect from being activated; those activations can still form Chain Links and pay their costs, but the field Trap effects resolve negated. Royal Decree does not negate its own effect, and does not impose a cost, damage, summoning restriction, usage limit, or one-time trigger. It ceases to negate effects when no longer face-up and resolved, or while its own effect is negated by an applicable other source. A Trap effect activated before Royal Decree is on the field may resolve negated if Royal Decree applies at that resolution. This negates Trap effects on the field, not arbitrary Graveyard effects.",
